{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_05_beg","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_05","title":"各有所長","storyCode":"RI-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4c9c1dcf09195df319450a18d95fe253c0e07fc88f86d710156beb96db3ed9b3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們已經來到雨林深處了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡比之前還要潮濕，樹木也要更加茂密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的腳下，小心別被絆倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有一個部族，我們可以過去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，好無聊，睡個午覺好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾？我聽說你在祭典上被祖瑪瑪打敗了，怎麼到我這來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"消息真靈通啊，依娜姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，聽特米米提到的時候我還不信，沒想到你這傢伙還真當上部族的頭領了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想的啊，這幫人擅自要跟著我，我有什麼辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼沒有來祭典？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這就是特米米介紹過的依娜姆了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，是活的外地人。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，這是你在外面帶回來的朋友？怎麼這麼害羞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士只是不怎麼喜歡說話而已。"}]},{"label":"嗨！","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喲！嘉維爾，你這個朋友和你一樣開朗啊。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？依娜姆，怎麼你也會薩爾貢語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我的官方身份是這一帶的信使啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"信使？哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你......唉，算了，你這個反應，好歹看得出你已經知道信使是什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"不像別的傢伙，我就算跟他們說信使，他們也不知道是什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你什麼時候變成信使的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我從一開始就是信使......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡好歹也是薩爾貢境內誒，你該不會覺得薩爾貢對這一片區域真的一無所知吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啥，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不是，據我所知，這裡幾百年前，其實是薩爾貢某聚落的一個礦場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"但是當時因為天災的原因，那座移動城市離開了，這片礦場也就廢棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"當時留下的人以及後來回來的人基本形成了現在的人口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"原本官方好像也是想過把最近的移動城市開過來重新利用一下的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"就十幾年前，你也知道的那次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那一次啊，我和祖瑪瑪都看到過，那傢伙從那天起就變得怪怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？哎，不過最後我也不知道是因為什麼放棄了，大概是勘測了一下發現這片礦區沒有那麼有價值吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟如果要把城市停在這片區域，和別的城市的距離就太遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說很久以前這片無人區好像還是挺繁榮的，也不知道是多久以前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不說這個，反正我大概嗯？是幾歲來著？算了，反正成為信使後就被派到這裡來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我難得找到人說這些話題，你就不能假裝聽得津津有味一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩。不過，既然你是信使，為什麼我感覺以前從沒見你離開過這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然是因為，這裡這麼封閉，我除了想去城裡買點東西，根本沒有信要寄啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"從我開始當信使到今天，真正出去了還和這裡有聯繫的人，只有你一個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"因為實在沒事做，我乾脆就沒事去最近的城市買點東西回來和大家做做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"久而久之，就變成大家口中做生意的依娜姆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，我以前都沒發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"就你以前那樣能發現才怪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，雖然我算是在城市裡長大，現在我也更喜歡在這邊的生活就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"簡簡單單，沒什麼不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一直都覺得你和雨林裡其他黎博利沒啥區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我就當你是在誇我了，所以你找我有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我先問一問，AUS是怎麼回事？不會是你找來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS？怎麼可能，她們可是就算是我這樣沒什麼見識的人都聽過名字的樂隊，我哪裡請得來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如說，我看到她們的時候才是最吃驚的那一個好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"她們真的只是路過而已，那段時間還是我給她們做的翻譯呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，說到這個我就來勁了，你來得正好，不懂的人我都不知道該怎麼向他吹噓這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有她們的親筆簽名唱片呢，你要不要看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我又不是她們的粉絲，只是覺得有點不可思議而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，看起來你在外面這麼久，品味沒有見長啊，嘉維爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"小心我揍你啊？比起這個，我和博士正要去找祖瑪瑪，路過你這裡，就想在你這裡補給一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。雖然老規矩是以物易物，不過既然你已經知道外面什麼樣了，你也可以用流通貨幣跟我交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，等等，被你一串問題給搞昏了，差點忘了我其實也有事找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有一個叫可頌的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌？她和我們一起的，我們正在找她呢，你見到她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以去集市那邊看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"走過路過不要錯過！新鮮出爐的原木雕刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"看看瞧瞧，從我阿爺那一代傳下來的礦石！用它打造武器，保證鋒利！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"居然有像樣的集市。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"真熱鬧。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這些吆喝都是我教給他們的，挺像那麼回事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，可頌就在那裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"集市的一角，可頌正在與一個阿達克利斯人對峙。\n可頌指了指對方手裡的礦石，再指了指自己手裡的貝殼，對方搖了搖頭。\n可頌皺了皺眉頭，一揮手，一副忍痛割愛的樣子。\n她從隨身的口袋中掏出一塊石頭，再指了指貝殼，然後指了指對方手裡的礦石，對方想了想，這一次點了點頭。\n交易過程中，可頌依然維持著苦瓜臉，但是在對方轉身後，她的臉上立刻浮現出了笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"這塊礦石真好看誒，嗯嗯，這下賺到了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌，你怎麼在這裡做起生意來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，博士！哎呀，我可算找到你們啦！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒出事吧？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，我好著呢~"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，博士，不要露出那副表情嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"我正打算讓依娜姆帶我去神廟找你們呢。"}]},{"label":"你能和這裡的人交流？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不能誒，但是做生意這種事，即使語言不通也沒關係的！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我前天在路上恰好撿到她，看她好像是外地人的樣子就把她帶到了這裡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"這個女孩子做生意很厲害啊，雖然語言不通，但用商人的語言和我的手下找到了交流的方法，很快就融入了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出來。可頌，你有遇到其他人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我也有問依娜姆這件事，不過她也沒聽說類似的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，至少你沒事，剩下的還有宴和煌。煌那傢伙，第一個主動跳下去的，我倒是不怎麼擔心，至於宴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，不好了，有一群阿達克利斯向我們部族殺過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？是哪家部族這麼不長眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是巨木部族的！但是領頭的是個拿著刀的怪胎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？怪胎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎麼了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我手下說有個拿著刀的怪胎帶著一群阿達克利斯殺過來了，拿著刀的怪胎是什麼東西啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，拿著刀，怪胎......難道說，是宴？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們的同伴？嘖，總之不管怎麼樣，他們好像已經殺進來了，嘉維爾，還有那邊那個帶兜帽的，你們也來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我也來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"小的們，上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，雖然你們聽不懂我在說什麼，但是加油哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，雖然一開始有些討厭，不過帶著這群傢伙到處打架好像也挺有樂趣的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，宴，你這傢伙在幹什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，嘉維爾，可頌，還有博士，嗨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"誰跟你嗨了！你怎麼帶人來襲擊村莊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這裡是嘉維爾你家嗎？那我不搶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"讓其他人也停下來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，可是，那個，他們聽不懂我說的話誒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，沒辦法，把這群傻子全部放倒吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉維爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["宴"]}]}
